    ["对前方范围内敌方发动刺击，造成*d点魔法伤害，命中时消耗全部<HighLight>足迹</>召唤残影进行追击（至多提升至*d点魔法伤害），并为敌方施加<HighLight>坠落</>，自身获得<HighLight>闪回</>。\n<FaintYellow>坠落</>\n使敌方怪物<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>。若消耗2层以上<HighLight>足迹</>，有<HighLight>42%</>的基础概率对敌方施加*f秒buffdisc(*id)的效果，若消耗3层<HighLight>足迹</>，有<HighLight>70%</>的基础概率使敌方玩家<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>，玩家目标被本技能<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>后，短时间内无法再次被本技能<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">浮空</>。\n<FaintYellow>闪回</>\n减少<HighLight>放逐</>、<HighLight>星云咏叹</>、<HighLight>戏法演绎</>、<HighLight>记录</>1秒冷却时间，若消耗3层<HighLight>足迹</>，额外减少<HighLight>skillname(*id)</>2秒冷却时间。"] = "Perform a stab on enemies in the range in front, dealing *d magic damage. Upon hitting, consume all <HighLight>Footprints</> to summon a remnant to pursue (up to *d magic damage), apply <HighLight>Falling</> to enemies, and gain <HighLight>Flashback</>. \n<FaintYellow>Falling</>\n causes enemy monsters to be <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launched</>. If more than 2 stacks of <HighLight>Footprints</> are consumed, there is a <HighLight>42%</> base chance to apply, for *f seconds, the effect of buffdisc(*id). If 3 stacks of <HighLight>Footprints</> are consumed, there is a <HighLight>70%</> base chance to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launch</> enemy players. After being <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launched</> by this skill, player targets cannot be <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"2\">launched</> again by this skill for a short time. \n<FaintYellow>Flashback</>\n reduces the cooldown of <HighLight>Exile</>, <HighLight>Nebula Aria</>, <HighLight>Trick Performance</>, and <HighLight>Record</> by 1 second. If 3 stacks of <HighLight>Footprints</> are consumed, additionally reduce the cooldown of <HighLight>skillname(*id)</> by 2 seconds.",
